{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0363_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4143ac7d09b5c5609b16c8becdf2d68463ff2614309554c1785268a7adee0c43", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。\n育の準備がそろそろ終わるはずだけど……）", "zh": "（今天要为写真杂志《偶像写真！！》拍摄。\n育的准备应该也快结束了，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0363_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "10ae07cfe6a72dba5544b036da62d2d30f7c4348ca8d58b8925f8bb38353db39", "ja": "「ふふふっ。{$P$}さん……\nわたし、見ちゃった」", "zh": "“呵呵呵。{$P$}先生……\n我，看见了哦”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0363_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5d296354556bc4cf12526fcce451fb52883ee37f705ec4bd2e867931fe993265", "ja": "えっ！？　……って、なんだ育か。\n着替え終わったんだな。", "zh": "咦！？……什么嘛，原来是育啊。\n已经换好衣服了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0363_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "484be2cd5b067d0bbb65283154925939a28803fe73750b9a2c456867ccb902a4", "ja": "そうじゃないの、{$P$}さん！\nえっとね、何か気づかなかった？", "zh": "不是这样的，{$P$}先生！  \n那个，你有没有注意到什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0363_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f880394818ea21accf7d455ce5edf5ffb6fae8c32937ab6d36f2e078a98ac1f3", "ja": "何か？　もしかして、衣装のことか？\nそれなら、育に似合ってるぞ。バッチリだ！", "zh": "什么？难道是服装的事？\n那套衣服很适合育哦。简直棒极了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0363_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "ec9fc2eda60c63f3af5a0e04b932d8a8b4cb171d2a234811cdf20b7f99e41875", "ja": "えへへ、ありがとう！　ほめ言葉はうれしいけど、\nちがうの。{$P$}さん、気づかない？", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢！虽然听到夸奖很开心，\n但不是这个。{$P$}先生，你没发现吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0363_1006_p", "source_sha256": "cde68575e6027f34aa5b8682ca1a95c7362b5c12e59f640d2b8c1b1546697b56", "ja": "えーっと……ごめん、ちょっとわからなくて。\n何かヒントをもらえるか？", "zh": "呃……抱歉，我有点没明白。能给我一点提示吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0363_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "7e6219d9a8cb2d30e132d8d7f26cd8a17fdfaf7461f9aa7f3345316fe9bb1761", "ja": "仕方ないなあ……一回だけだからね？\nんんっ……よし。", "zh": "真拿你没办法……就这一次哦？\n嗯……好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0363_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "4c17667dd40dc42568ad7ee65122b5cc6ef6bc4cd0b6d3558e6c45cb859f5fef", "ja": "「わたしは、なんでもお見通しなんだから？」\n……どう？　今のでわかった？", "zh": "“我可是什么都能看透的哦？”\n……怎么样？听了这个明白了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0363_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b5c11a2c5e05044250b2a4d4f7a3e9cf363fa02abb296527cb2e0f5dd869cdb1", "ja": "今のがヒント？　話し方がいつもと……あっ！\n今日の育は、スパイなんだな！", "zh": "刚才那是提示？说话方式和往常不一样……啊！\n今天的小育是间谍！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0363_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "62eb8e9e60dba6325979b4d9a071f5813a939224946f6b338c0940fec2d74f99", "ja": "えへへ、大せいかい！　今日のために、\nいろんなスパイのお話を見て、勉強してきたんだ。", "zh": "嘿嘿，完全正确！为了今天，我看了好多关于间谍的故事，学习了一番。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0363_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "1bc2689791bf7f097870a66ee013d3f31b8c835e4581c5ce4457525e3c879aab", "ja": "{$P$}さんがわかったんだから、\nこの後の撮影も、きっと大丈夫だね！", "zh": "既然弄懂了{$P$}先生，\n后面的拍摄也肯定没问题了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0363_1012_p", "source_sha256": "2fb89abddec90131ddc89dda00c5788a173b042c50f89f9816fbee8cc998f63c", "ja": "そうだな。いい撮影になりそうだ！　ところで……\n育が言ってた「見ちゃった」って何のことだったんだ？", "zh": "是啊。看来会是一场很棒的拍摄！对了……育说的“看到了”到底是指什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0363_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "673b0b8029c5ce97f7e796d00adc0e070885ee25fc771decb3645b31f0d71500", "ja": "それは……ナイショなんだ。スパイはミステリアスな\n方がいいって、このみさんが教えてくれたの。", "zh": "那个嘛……是秘密。木实小姐告诉我，间谍还是神秘一点比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0363_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "58080216d9ce40802faf1fef4b1d5561293cdfb09c1d4e6dea7706ddec6c94f2", "ja": "あっ。ミステリアスっていうのは、秘密が多い人の\nことを言うんだよ。だからね、今はナイショなの。", "zh": "啊。神秘的意思，就是指秘密很多的人哦。\n所以呢，现在要保密。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0363_1015_p", "source_sha256": "d7b1a09dc981bd84e2c8a5278e2a41f3dd86adfab541bf7a2c88d92c2729319f", "ja": "な、なるほど……。それじゃ「見ちゃった」って\nいうのは、育の演技だったのか。", "zh": "原、原来如此……。那么，所谓“看到了”，是育的演技吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0363_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "96348724c08bc0066556c7b3acdb248f7334a013a84c44c57dc15f3956dd44c4", "ja": "えっ、違うよ？　わたし、本当に見たんだ！\n……あ、撮影が始まるみたい。いってきまーす！", "zh": "咦？不是哦？我真的看到了！\n……啊，好像要开始拍摄了。我先过去啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0363_1017_p", "source_sha256": "94eae4eae25055e54744b71a4c718aa58b27e9057c8905053805ebba8b0f3da0", "ja": "えっ？　育、ちょっと……！", "zh": "咦？育，等一下……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0363_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0363_1018_p", "source_sha256": "885790f155478370ed9dbdb799e1c9e54c62ea2fc5145d0ed62988366b0e0a66", "ja": "（育の撮影は大成功！　大人っぽい姿が好評だ！\nしかし、育は何をみたんだろう？　気になるな……）", "zh": "（育的拍摄大获成功！她那成熟的模样广受好评！不过，育到底看到了什么呢？真让人在意……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
